# Prunes local build products from the build context. .git is deliberately NOT listed: the image
# must carry the full mayhem-branch history. Fixtures and seeds (tests/, mayhem/*/testsuite, which
# include committed .o/.a files) stay in the context; build.sh recreates build-tests/ itself.
/build-tests/
/build/
/out/
/CMakeCache.txt
/CMakeFiles/
/tests/ELFIOTest
/tests/elfio_fuzzer
